# Level 1's screen set-up ($81:88C4, Level01ScreenSetup: an RTS), which no
# script reaches: no play loads level 1. A unit call of LevelScreenSetup
# ($81:87EF, by JSR as the level's start calls it) on the first level's
# state with the level ($035E) set to 1 takes the table's jump there. (The
# machine is put back after the call.)
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
set $00035E 01,00
call 8187EF db=80 p=30
